{"id": "69772", "title": "情深欲染", "author": "郁色虫子", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 23, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69772.htm", "intro": "【总有那么一个人带着她走出禁锢的心牢走向璀璨人生】\r\n 妈妈的自杀，父亲的薄情……\r\n 她信奉无情则无伤，竖起满身的刺独行世间\r\n 父亲的死，重回旧地，一场为了股份的婚姻，最后成了甩不开的羁绊\r\n 说不清是怎样的缘分能让爱情修成了正果\r\n 世人都用四叶草来形容爱情，两株三叶草各自舍弃一片叶子变成了四叶草，那她想她肯定是发育不良畸形的三叶草，只有一片叶子，而季楠为了她舍弃了一片叶子，并用他的坚持他的爱给她养育出了一片新的叶子。\r\n \r\n 推荐虫子的刚完结文：\r\n #favorite_1{color:#DC143C;font-weight:bold;border-style:double;}", "base": "files/article/html/69/69772", "chapters": [{"title": "咖啡泼了", "file": "10693204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "奇了怪了", "file": "10693205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "HIGH极了", "file": "10693206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "包厢去了", "file": "10693207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谈话崩了", "file": "10693208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相亲了【修改】新章节", "file": "10693209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "落水了", "file": "10693210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "醒来了", "file": "10693211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "斗嘴了", "file": "10693212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "原谅了", "file": "10693213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "撞上了", "file": "10693214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "被骂了", "file": "10693215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "喝药了", "file": "10693216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "报复了", "file": "10693217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "喝醉了【补】", "file": "10693218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "惊吓了", "file": "10693219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "触动了", "file": "10693220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "吵醒了", "file": "10693221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "又住了", "file": "10693222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Vip章节 1", "file": "10693223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10693224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10693225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10693226.html", "av